WEBVTT

1
00:00:08.134 --> 00:00:12.085
Kids: Hi, Mr. Miller.

2
00:00:12.086 --> 00:00:15.959
Mr. Miller: Hi, kids. Is it time for recess?

3
00:00:15.960 --> 00:00:19.812
Daisy: Yes. Do you know what our reading prize is yet?

4
00:00:19.813 --> 00:00:24.613
Coby: Remember, Mr. Miller, you promised to do something wacky!

5
00:00:24.614 --> 00:00:28.207
Mr. Miller: Only if Room Two reads one hundred books.

6
00:00:28.208 --> 00:00:35.869
Daisy: We will. We have Jenna in our class!

7
00:00:35.870 --> 00:00:38.621
Coby: Do you know what you're going to do yet?

8
00:00:38.622 --> 00:00:40.839
Mr. Miller: I have a few ideas.

9
00:00:40.840 --> 00:00:47.064
Mr. Miller: I might let someone throw a pie in my face.

10
00:00:47.065 --> 00:00:50.175
Mark: Ooh! Can I do it?

11
00:00:50.176 --> 00:00:52.540
Daisy: What are your other ideas?

12
00:00:52.541 --> 00:00:59.259
Mr. Miller: I might dance on the school roof.

13
00:00:59.260 --> 00:01:02.475
Mr. Miller: Or eat some worms.

14
00:01:02.476 --> 00:01:05.272
Kara: Yuck!

15
00:01:05.273 --> 00:01:08.447
Mr. Miller: Whatever it is, it will be wacky.

16
00:01:08.448 --> 00:01:14.448
I promise. Bye, kids.

17
00:01:14.449 --> 00:01:18.141
Mark: I can't wait to see what he does.

18
00:01:18.142 --> 00:01:22.287
Coby: It's going to be great.

19
00:01:22.288 --> 00:01:39.292
Kara: Everybody had better be reading!

20
00:01:39.293 --> 00:01:42.176
Daisy: Let's check the chart after lunch.

21
00:01:42.177 --> 00:01:53.832
Daisy: Come on, Jenna! It's jump-rope time!

22
00:01:53.833 --> 00:01:56.658
Mark: I read five books so far.

23
00:01:56.659 --> 00:01:58.605
Coby: I read six.

24
00:01:58.606 --> 00:02:02.460
Kara: I finished my tenth book this morning.

25
00:02:02.461 --> 00:02:06.018
Kara: That's more than anyone else in the class.

26
00:02:06.019 --> 00:02:08.297
Daisy: I don't think so, Kara.

27
00:02:08.298 --> 00:02:11.935
Daisy: Jenna's probably read way more books than you.

28
00:02:11.936 --> 00:02:14.657
Kara: No, she hasn't, Daisy.

29
00:02:14.658 --> 00:02:18.684
Look at the chart!

30
00:02:18.685 --> 00:02:20.707
Mark: Uh-oh.

31
00:02:20.708 --> 00:02:26.041
Coby: Oh boy. Jenna!

32
00:02:26.042 --> 00:02:31.055
Jenna: Kara's right. I haven't even read one book yet.

33
00:02:31.056 --> 00:02:36.322
Jenna: If we lose, it'll be all my fault!
